  "text": "This workflow tracks client response times and Slack engagement to flag churn risks. When clients start pulling back, message volume drops and feedback turnaround stretches from hours to days. Account leads miss these subtle disengagement signals because daily deliverables distract them from high-level client sentiment. Connect Slack and Gmail to an Airtable health tracker that flags cooling client accounts automatically. You protect recurring revenue and retain top clients.",
